0 392 206 [
[(The synthesis \050[osc~], [*~], [+~ 0.1] and [cos~]\051 is a very)]
[(simple application of the waveshaping technique. The [osc~])]
[(oscillator \050whose amplitude depends on the ADSR generator\051 is)]
[(used as an index into the [cos~] wavetable. An additional)]
[(offset \050"symmetry"\051 controls how the oscillator's waveform is)]
[(centered on the wavetable. If the offset is zero, the)]
[(oscillator reads into the \050even\051 cosine function \050producing)]
[(only even harmonics\051. If the offset is 0.25, we read 1/4 wave)]
[(into the cosine function: the result is an odd function and we)]
[(get odd harmonics. Between the two we get mixtures of even and)]
[(odd.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
